### FIX 5: MODIFY bootstrap.ts (Effect.all + Ref accumulation, return BootstrapResult)
Replace the run function body. BEFORE (lines 38-51):
```typescript
const run = Effect.gen(function* () {
  const ctx = yield* InstanceState.context
  yield* Effect.logInfo("bootstrapping").pipe(Effect.annotateLogs("directory", ctx.directory))
  yield* config.get()
  yield* plugin.init()
  yield* Effect.forEach(
    [reference, lsp, shareNext, format, file, fileWatcher, vcs, snapshot, project],
    (s) => s.init().pipe(Effect.catchCause((cause) => Effect.logWarning("init failed", { cause }))),
    { concurrency: "unbounded", discard: true },
